{% set withHourPrefix = (withHourPrefix is defined and withHourPrefix == true) %}
<div class="program-mass mass has-details meet" data-beginHour="{{ mass.begin|date('H:i', timezone) }}" data-duration="{{ mass.duration.format('%H:%I') }}">
    {{ include('EventBundle:Unavailability/Mass:header.html.twig', {'mass': mass, 'timezone': timezone, 'withHourPrefix': withHourPrefix}) }}
    <div class="details">
        <p>{{ mass.description|nl2br }}</p>
        {{ include('EventBundle:Unavailability/Mass:footer.html.twig', {timezone: timezone, mass: mass}) }}
    </div>
</div>
